{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24512","headline":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 二 · 白居易","name":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晏驾辞双阙，灵仪出九衢。\n上云归碧落，下席葬苍梧。\n蓂晚余尧历，龟新啓夏图。\n三朝联棣萼，从古帝王无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}